  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>When you&#39;re creating a VM in your lab, you can now select one of the Data Science and Bitnami images. After these images are enabled by&nbsp;the Lab owner, they will appear in the list of available images at VM creation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/059717d3-157e-4e7e-8863-e526a67e3c28.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/f38b0181-99a8-4c9c-96ff-c86fdde4b8e7.png\" title=\"image\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>As a lab admin, you need to review and accept the terms of use for these images in order to enable them for the users of your lab.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/288e6d36-e7a2-4063-85c3-1108c904834c.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/ca12802b-c994-491a-8ab6-dd4e08276d7e.png\" title=\"image\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/a2431e3d-970d-4bfd-aa20-647c8c122d22.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/ba4589d7-35da-4d92-8a66-f3b483d0600e.png\" title=\"image\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "When you're creating a VM in your lab, you can now select one of the Data Science and Bitnami images. After these images are enabled by the Lab owner, they will appear in the list of available images at VM creation.\n\nAs a lab admin, you need to review and accept the terms of use for these images in order to enable them for the users of your lab."
  },
